title: "Project Phoenix: Autonomous Offline AI Prosthetic System for Skin-Grafted Transhumeral Amputees"
abstract: "Project Phoenix is an assistive bionic prosthetic platform featuring offline neural gesture classification (Syntiant NDP120), vision-EMG intent fusion, and socket pressure interlocks specifically engineered for amputees with skin-grafted residual limbs."
